ions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/pgp-signature","state":"uploaded","size":444,"digest":"sha256:f6f963f0b158dd37d7a1843f92d6c335df18ada73781c28fad1ae58ce71e5542","download_count":79,"created_at":"2026-11-18T07:46:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:46:38Z"},{"id":762444306,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPYG9FM4tcfoS","name":"CC-Switch-v4.0.35-Windows-Portable.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":20225169,"digest":"sha256:a0624730e9863dce033fa13fbf9def3a3c3ecaa70dc92fbf2c21755f4726c2e9","download_count":3025,"created_at":"2026-11-18T07:46:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:46:39Z"},{"id":762444331,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPYG9FM4tcfor","name":"CC-Switch-v4.0.35-Windows.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":20176896,"digest":"sha256:441cca1acff32a3226ba4cc08bf934f0bf40c3b416aba5f04d96bef9c19d6e64","download_count":8589,"created_at":"2026-11-18T07:46:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:46:39Z"},{"id":762444316,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPYG9FM4tcfoc","name":"CC-Switch-v4.0.35-Windows.msi.sig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/pgp-signature","state":"uploaded","size":440,"digest":"sha256:44dc7b76a35a96b0ca56b5b7571a7d0d43f533cb2694b9c383e22fb26c223ad5","download_count":121,"created_at":"2026-11-18T07:46:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:46:38Z"},{"id":762444313,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPYG9FM4tcfoZ","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":6026,"digest":"sha256:cb8a21625253232cf0f857856af4babd03c397f1bd21808a8a795968c38e7bd0","download_count":20087,"created_at":"2026-11-18T07:46:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:46:38Z"}],"body":"# CC Switch v4.0.35\n\n本版本让 Claude Code / Claude Desktop 里用 ChatGPT 账号的 Codex 卡片能用上 **GPT-6.2**，会话管理里可以看到 Codex `/goal` 的**完整目标**，请求详情里的请求 ID 可以**一键复制**。\n\n另外修复了 Claude Code 的 auto 模式在关不掉思考的模型上被整体拦下；Codex 聚合模式和「打开终端」报 Responses-Lite 需要 `reasoning.context`；Codex 压缩上下文后第一条请求被拒；用量页自定义日期选到很早的年份时卡死；Skill 的托管副本不在了就卸载不掉等问题。\n\n**[English →](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/blob/main/docs/release-notes/v4.0.35-en.md) | [日本語版 →](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/blob/main/docs/release-notes/v4.0.35-ja.md)**\n\n---\n\n## 新增\n\n### 会话管理里显示 Codex `/goal` 的完整目标\n\n目标超过 700 字节时，Codex 注入的上下文里不写目标内容，会话管理里也就看不到目标（见 [#9647](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/issues/9647)）。现在从会话记录里读出完整目标，显示成一步「目标 · 状态」，展开即是完整内容；目标和状态都没变的重复记录不再显示。\n\n### 请求详情里可以复制完整的请求 ID\n\n请求详情里过长的值会被省略号截断，像 Codex 的 `resp_...` 这类长请求 ID 没法完整复制去对日志（见 [#9681](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/issues/9681)）。现在请求 ID 后面多了一个复制按钮。\n\n### 新增 GPT-6.2 Sol / Astra 的价格\n\n按官方标准档（272K 以内）的价格计费；长上下文档、Batch / Fast 等档位和 GPT-6 一样暂不区分。\n\n---\n\n## 修复\n\n- **Claude Code / Claude Desktop 里用 ChatGPT 账号的 Codex 卡片获取不到 GPT-6.2，手动填了也报「not supported when using Codex with a ChatGPT account」**（[#9678](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/pull/9678)，见 [#9670](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/issues/9670)）：OpenAI 按 Codex 客户端版本决定给哪些模型，CC Switch 报的版本太旧。现在按 Codex 0.169.0 请求，没有写死任何模型 ID。\n- **Claude Code 的 auto 模式在关不掉思考的模型上，Bash、MCP 等工具调用全部被拒**（见 [#8887](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/issues/8887)、[#9671](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/issues/9671)）：auto 模式的判断请求要求关闭思考，MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 这类模型直接报 400，Claude Code 就认为判断服务不可用。现在经路由时（Claude Code 和 Claude Desktop），Anthropic 格式的上游这样报错会去掉关闭思考的字段，在同一家重试一次。上游本来接受的请求原样发送，不影响缓存。\n- **Codex 聚合模式下报「Responses-Lite requires `reasoning.context` to be `all_turns`」，同一家直连和路由都正常**（见 [#9665](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/issues/9665)）：卡片没写模型目录时，聚合模式改用和直连一样的 GPT-6 官方设置。从卡片「打开终端」时出现的同一个报错也一并修好。\n- **Codex 经路由转成 Chat 格式时，压缩上下文后第一条请求被要求严格的网关以「message content cannot be empty」拒绝**（见 [#9660](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/issues/9660)）：压缩时只含图片的用户消息会变成空消息，现在转成 Chat 格式时去掉内容为空的用户消息，其他消息不变。\n- **用量页自定义日期的起点选到 1905 年这类很早的年份时，客户端卡死**（见 [#9691](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/issues/9691)）：现在只能选从第一条用量记录到今天之间的日期，范围外的日期不可选，手动输入的也会被拉回范围内。\n- **Skill 的托管副本已经不在时卸载不掉**（[#9669](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/pull/9669)，见 [#9668](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/issues/9668)）。\n\n---\n\n## 致谢\n\n感谢 @imfuxiao（Codex 卡片支持 GPT-6.2）、@Maharramoff（卸载托管副本已不在的 Skill）、@SaladDay（拆分本地路由的转发代码、数据库访问改用应用类型）的贡献。\n\n特别感谢以下贡献者：你们的 PR 发现并修复了真实的问题，只是同样的问题后来在主线上另行修好，PR 因此关闭。@xunapro（[#4262](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/pull/4262)，同类 PR 里最早提出 S3 服务商选择没被记住、阿里云 OSS / 腾讯云 COS 因路径式地址报 403）、@mercutiojohn（[#8547](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/pull/8547)，找准了 Gemini CLI 供应商获取模型列表失败的三个原因）。\n\n感谢 @chencyan364、@DemosHume、@LAN-SHH、@mouse8867、@leafsnow、@zhuqiang1248、@ramonmi、@zx2121651、@VICCC-0x90 提出需求、报告问题和提供复现信息。\n\n完整的技术细节请见 [CHANGELOG](https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)。\n","reactions":{"total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":14}
